ing","instructions":"","sourceHeading":"Questions 27-30","sourceHtml":"<div class=\"source-question-section-content\"><div class=\"source-section-content-wrapper\"><p>Complete the flow-chart below.</p><p>Choose FOUR answers from the box and write the correct letter, A – F, next to Questions 27-30.</p><p><strong>Market Research Using a Business’s Own Resources</strong></p><p>Begin with staff education to maximize the chances of success.</p><p>↓</p><p>Give staff examples of <span class=\"source-question-item\"><span class=\"options-drop-zone dnd-zone\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">27</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-trainer-2-t6-l-q27\" data-luma-kind=\"drop\"></span></span></span> that will be helpful every day.</p><p>↓</p><p>The BQR Group says that staff should make use of <span class=\"source-question-item\"><span class=\"options-drop-zone dnd-zone\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">28</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-trainer-2-t6-l-q28\" data-luma-kind=\"drop\"></span></span></span> each week.</p><p>↓</p><p>Having <span class=\"source-question-item\"><span class=\"options-drop-zone dnd-zone\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">29</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-trainer-2-t6-l-q29\" data-luma-kind=\"drop\"></span></span></span> is motivating for staff, according to Business Guide.</p><p>↓</p><p>Provide detailed feedback about any changes that you decide to make</p><p>↓</p><p>Allow staff to have <span class=\"source-question-item\"><span class=\"options-drop-zone dnd-zone\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">30</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-trainer-2-t6-l-q30\" data-luma-kind=\"drop\"></span></span></span> to ensure continued participation.</p></div><div class=\"options-dnd-panel dnd-panel dnd-panel--inline\"><div class=\"dnd-panel-instruction\">Drag and drop an option to fill in each blank.</div><div class=\"dnd-cards-container\"><div class=\"dnd-card\" data-luma-drag=\"A\"><span class=\"dnd-label\">A.</span><span class=\"dnd-text\">written records</span></div><div class=\"dnd-card\" data-luma-drag=\"B\"><span class=\"dnd-label\">B.</span><span class=\"dnd-text\">online studies</span></div><div class=\"dnd-card\" data-luma-drag=\"C\"><span class=\"dnd-label\">C.</span><span class=\"dnd-text\">specific questions</span></div><div class=\"dnd-card\" data-luma-drag=\"D\"><span class=\"dnd-label\">D.</span><span class=\"dnd-text\">individual responsibility</span></div><div class=\"dnd-card\" data-luma-drag=\"E\"><span class=\"dnd-label\">E.</span><span class=\"dnd-text\">proper planning</span></div><div class=\"dnd-card\" data-luma-drag=\"F\"><span class=\"dnd-label\">F.</span><span class=\"dnd-text\">regular meetings</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"source-questions\"></div>","sourceQuestionCount":4}],"audio_fallbacks":["https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/ielts_trainer_2_academic_listening_test_6_3.wav"],"order_index":3},{"id":"en-trainer-2-t6-l-p4","title":"Part 4","part_number":4,"passage_text":"","audio_url":"https://ielts-listening-audio.engnovatemedia.com/3147838-ielts_trainer_2_academic_listening_test_6_4.wav","question_groups":[{"id":"en-trainer-2-t6-l-g4-0","type":"source_html","ieltsQuestionType":"note_completion","instructions":"","sourceHeading":"Questions 31-37","sourceHtml":"<div class=\"source-question-section-content\"><div class=\"source-section-content-wrapper\"><p>Complete the notes below.</p><p>Write ONE WORD ONLY for each answer</p><p><strong>Drinking Water</strong></p><p><strong>Introduction</strong></p><ul><li>Drinking water is essential for human life.</li><li>The ‘8 glasses a day’ rule is a myth, except for the <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">31</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-trainer-2-t6-l-q31\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> .</li></ul><p><strong>Some effects of water on the body</strong></p><ul><li>Drinking before <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">32</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-trainer-2-t6-l-q32\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> may assist weight loss.</li><li>Dr. Amaldi’s study shows that water speeds up <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">33</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-trainer-2-t6-l-q33\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span></li><li>A US research study showed that dehydrated bodies cannot control <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">34</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-trainer-2-t6-l-q34\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> so well</li><li>There is no evidence that drinking water results in better <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">35</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-trainer-2-t6-l-q35\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span></li></ul><p><strong>The brain</strong></p><ul><li>Women who drank lots of water had fewer <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">36</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-trainer-2-t6-l-q36\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span></li><li>Men suffered more <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">37</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-trainer-2-t6-l-q37\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> with insufficient water.</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"source-questions\"><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div></div>","sourceQuestionCount":7},{"id":"en-trainer-2-t6-l-g4-1","type":"source_html","ieltsQuestionType":"note_completion","instructions":"","sourceHeading":"Questions 38-40","sourceHtml":"<div class=\"source-question-section-content\"><div class=\"source-section-content-wrapper\"><p>Complete the summary below.</p><p>Write ONE WORD ONLY for each answer.</p><p><strong>Too much water?</strong></p><p>Drinking too much water is not a common problem. Australian research has shown that people have difficulty <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">38</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-trainer-2-t6-l-q38\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> when they have drunk enough. But occasionally people have become sick from too much water, particularly groups of <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">39</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-trainer-2-t6-l-q39\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> . This may be because they have high levels of <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">40</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-trainer-2-t6-l-q40\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> in their blood. The best advice is to drink when you are thirsty.</p></div></div><div class=\"source-questions\"><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div></div>","sourceQuestionCount":3}],"audio_fallbacks":["https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/ielts_trainer_2_academic_listening_test_6_4.wav"],"order_index":4}],"questions":[{"id":"en-trainer-2-t6-l-q1","part_id":"en-trainer-2-t6-l-p1","group_id":"en-trainer-2-t6-l-g1-0","question_type":"source_text","ieltsQuestionType":"table_completion","question_text":"","correct_answer":"train","correct_answer_variants":["train"],"answerCount":1,"sourceNumbers":[1],"sourceInputName":"ielts_listening_answer_3147048_1","order_index":1,"points":1},{"id":"en-trainer-2-t6-l-q2","part_id":"en-trainer-2-t6-l-p1","group_id":"en-trainer-2-t6-l-g1-0","question_type":"source_text","ieltsQuestionType":"table_completion","question_text":"","correct_answer":"5/five","correct_answer_variants":["5","five"],"answerCount":1,"so